  "href": "zero_sum/zero_sum_dantzig_proof_spine.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Dantzig Proof Spine for Minimax</h1>\n<p>Dantzig's proof represents the minimax theorem through an augmented linear\nsystem.  A basis state stores rows of the inverse basis matrix, a lexicographic\ncondition prevents cycling, and optimality inequalities encode the game-theoretic\nguarantees.</p>\n<p>At an optimal basis, the extracted row strategy is nonnegative and satisfies\nthe row player's guarantee inequalities.  The same basis data extracts a column\nstrategy for player II.  The pivot step updates the inverse basis while\npreserving the lexicographic condition and strictly decreasing the leading row\nin lexicographic order.</p>",
